# what: Muralla bank, a long held key in the amount entry (bankpro A2D8, #80): Deposit, U held 45 and D held 40 boundaries (the repeat delay 35, 34, ... drops under the boundary period, so several repeats and their redraws fall between boundaries), X deposits the rest, Check balance, out with Alt
